<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-core#TextileApparel> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "TextileApparel is a final textile product category for apparel and apparel accessories. The supplied EU DPP Core snapshot does not declare a separate FinalProduct class, so final-product status remains a local textile distinction under dpp:Product. It is narrower than TextileProduct and should not be confused with the whole textile product domain."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-core#TextileApparel> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceLocator> "JRC Preparatory Study, relevant section, printed page 14, lines 167-170; JRC Preparatory Study, Section 3.2.1, printed pages 24-25, lines 443-468; JRC Preparatory Study, Section 3.2.1, Table 7, printed page 24; caption line 450."@en .
