<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-core#TextileFibre> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Unit of matter characterised by flexibility, fineness and a high ratio of length to maximum transverse dimension, suitable for textile applications."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-core#TextileFibre> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-core> .
