<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-core#TextileFibre> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "TextileFibre is modelled as a textile product when it is represented as an identifiable fibre batch or traceability object. Its incorporation into yarn, fabric or another product is represented with dpp:isComponentOf."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-core#TextileFibre> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceLocator> "JRC Preparatory Study, relevant section, printed page 14, lines 154-160."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-core#TextileFibre> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceType> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#adaptedDefinition> .
