# https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Durability
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Durability> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Durability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Durability> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Durability> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://susproc.jrc.ec.europa.eu/product-bureau/sites/default/files/2025-12/Textile-Prep-Study_3rd-Milestone_20251212.pdf> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Durability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ability of a product to maintain over time its function and performance under specified conditions of use, maintenance and repair."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Durability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Durability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Durability"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Durability> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#evidenceStatus> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#explicitEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Durability> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "Through the alignment txtdur:Durability rdfs:subClassOf dpp:Durability, this class inherits dpp:QualityIndicator and dpp:QuantitativeProperty. This is an inherited EU DPP Core commitment: it does not make a durability instance a numeric value. Numerical observations and results remain represented through Textile Assessment and txtcon:QuantitativeValue."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Durability> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceLocator> "JRC Annex 13.10.1, printed page 468, lines 11065-11067."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Durability> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceType> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#adaptedDefinition> .
