# https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ElasticityLoss
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ElasticityLoss> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ElasticityLoss> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#StructuralFailureMode> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ElasticityLoss> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ElasticityLoss> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Structural failure mode corresponding to loss of elasticity, elastic recovery or stretch-related functionality of a textile product or fabric."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ElasticityLoss> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ElasticityLoss> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Elasticity loss"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ElasticityLoss> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Loss of elasticity"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ElasticityLoss> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#evidenceStatus> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#explicitEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ElasticityLoss> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#evidenceStatus> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#reconstructedEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ElasticityLoss> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "Elasticity loss is kept distinct from loss of dimensional stability. A product may lose elastic recovery without necessarily being described primarily as dimensionally unstable."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ElasticityLoss> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceLocator> "CIRPASS Textile Ontology modelling specification, version 1.1.0."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ElasticityLoss> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceType> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingAbstraction> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ElasticityLoss> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyIncreasesLikelihoodOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#LossOfComfort> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ExternalDamage
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ExternalDamage> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
