<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ExternalDamage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ExternalDamage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "External damage"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ExternalDamage> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceLocator> "CIRPASS Textile Ontology modelling specification, version 1.1.0."@en .
