# https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#FabricHandle
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#FabricHandle> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#FabricHandle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#FabricTactileCharacteristic> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#FabricHandle> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://susproc.jrc.ec.europa.eu/product-bureau/sites/default/files/2025-12/Textile-Prep-Study_3rd-Milestone_20251212.pdf> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#FabricHandle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Fabric tactile characteristic concerning softness, smoothness, flexibility and overall sensation when touched."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#FabricHandle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#FabricHandle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Fabric handle"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#FabricHandle> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Fabric hand"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#FabricHandle> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Fabric softness"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#FabricHandle> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Hand feel"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#FabricHandle> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#evidenceStatus> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#explicitEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#FabricHandle> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "Fabric handle is modelled as a fabric tactile characteristic, not as a simple fabric structural characteristic and not as an assessment result. Quantitative or qualitative measurements of softness, handle or touch should be represented through the assessment module when a concrete method or result is recorded."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#FabricHandle> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "Table 180 relates fabric softness or handle to fibre characteristics. The influence links are represented as weak annotation-level relations, not as deterministic OWL causal axioms."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#FabricHandle> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceLocator> "JRC Preparatory Study, Section 13.10.2, printed pages 488-491, lines 11875-11888; JRC Preparatory Study, relevant section, Table 178, printed page 302; caption line 9109."@en .
