<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#FibreCharacteristic> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "This class corresponds to the aggregated MAT-001 concept. MAT-004 Fibre type is represented in TEXTILE_CORE through txt:FibreTypeConcept and txtcs:FibreTypeScheme, and used through txt:hasFibreType on txt:FibreCompositionComponent. It is therefore not duplicated as a textile structure class in this module."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#FibreCharacteristic> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "This is modelled as an OWL class because it is a semantic category and potential target of assessment/indicator relations, not merely a codelist value."@en .
