<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#RepairProcess> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://susproc.jrc.ec.europa.eu/product-bureau/sites/default/files/2025-12/Textile-Prep-Study_3rd-Milestone_20251212.pdf> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#RepairProcess> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Repair can extend the usable lifetime of a textile product, but this module does not import TEXTILE_INDICATOR. Links from repair to product lifetime indicators should be handled in TEXTILE_INDICATOR or in a cross-module relation layer."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#RepairProcess> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#RepairProcess> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Repair process"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#RepairProcess> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#evidenceStatus> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#reconstructedEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#RepairProcess> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#evidenceStatus> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#supportingEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#RepairProcess> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "Repair can extend the usable lifetime of a textile product. Product lifetime indicators are represented in TEXTILE_INDICATOR, and any formal link should be handled there or in a cross-module relation layer."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#RepairProcess> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "This class represents a repair activity or process type. Repairability capability, repair service information and repairability assessment belong to Textile Repairability."@en .
