<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#TargetFabricDensity> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://susproc.jrc.ec.europa.eu/product-bureau/sites/default/files/2025-12/Textile-Prep-Study_3rd-Milestone_20251212.pdf> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#TargetFabricDensity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A process target specification stating the intended thread or loop density of the resulting fabric."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#TargetFabricDensity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#TargetFabricDensity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Target fabric density"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#TargetFabricDensity> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "Fabric density is related to thread count or loop density. Its effects on breathability, handle and appearance are mediated by fabric type and construction."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#TargetFabricDensity> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "The process-side target remains distinct from the resulting characteristic represented in Textile Structure."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#TargetFabricDensity> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "This class is not declared equivalent to txtstr:ThreadCount. FabricDensity is process-side and may cover thread density, loop density or related construction-density settings; ThreadCount is the structure-side fabric characteristic currently represented in TEXTILE_STRUCTURE."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#TargetFabricDensity> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceLocator> "JRC Preparatory Study, Section 13.10.2, printed pages 493-495, lines 11902-11920; JRC Preparatory Study, relevant section, Table 182, printed page 302; caption line 9114."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#TargetFabricDensity> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceType> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#adaptedDefinition> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#TargetFabricDensity> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicalInfluenceOn> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#FabricAppearance> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#TargetFabricDensity> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicalInfluenceOn> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#FabricBreathability> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#TargetFabricDensity> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicalInfluenceOn> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#FabricHandle> .
