<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-repairability#RefurbishmentProcess> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://susproc.jrc.ec.europa.eu/product-bureau/sites/default/files/2025-12/Textile-Prep-Study_3rd-Milestone_20251212.pdf> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-repairability#RefurbishmentProcess> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Process involving preparation, cleaning, testing, servicing and, where necessary, repair to restore a textile product within its originally intended use and performance range."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-repairability#RefurbishmentProcess> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-repairability> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-repairability#RefurbishmentProcess> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Refurbishment process"@en .
