<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-repairability#RemanufacturingProcess> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://susproc.jrc.ec.europa.eu/product-bureau/sites/default/files/2025-12/Textile-Prep-Study_3rd-Milestone_20251212.pdf> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-repairability#RemanufacturingProcess> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Process producing a new textile product from waste objects, products or components, with at least one change that may affect performance, purpose or type. It is distinct from material recycling."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-repairability#RemanufacturingProcess> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-repairability> .
