<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#ThreadCount> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://susproc.jrc.ec.europa.eu/product-bureau/sites/default/files/2025-12/Textile-Prep-Study_3rd-Milestone_20251212.pdf> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#ThreadCount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Fabric construction characteristic expressing the number of threads per specified unit length in a woven fabric."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#ThreadCount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#ThreadCount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Thread count"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#ThreadCount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#TargetFabricDensity> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#ThreadCount> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Number of threads"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#ThreadCount> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Thread density"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#ThreadCount> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#evidenceStatus> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#explicitEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#ThreadCount> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "Although the JRC uses the term thread count, its definition is a density per unit length. A quantitative value should therefore include a reciprocal-length unit rather than a dimensionless count."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#ThreadCount> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "Thread count is represented in TEXTILE_STRUCTURE as a fabric construction characteristic. The related process-side concept txtprc:TargetFabricDensity remains a fabric manufacturing parameter. The two concepts should not be merged automatically; one describes a product/fabric characteristic, the other a process parameter or target."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#ThreadCount> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceLocator> "JRC Preparatory Study, Section 13.10.2, printed pages 493-494, lines 11902-11907; JRC Preparatory Study, relevant section, Table 182, printed page 302; caption line 9114."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-structure#ThreadCount> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceType> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#adaptedDefinition> .
